  "question": {
    "text": "A passenger in a open car travelling at $30 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ throws a ball out over the bonnet. Relative to the car the initial velocity of the ball is $20 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ at $60^{\\circ}$ to the horizontal. The angle of projection of the ball with respect to the horizontal road will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\\right)$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right)$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\\begin{array}{l}\n\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{bc}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}}=\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}}-\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{c}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}} \\\\\n20 \\cos 60^{\\circ}=\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}}-30 \\\\\n\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}}=40 ;\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{bc}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}}=\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}}-\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{c}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}} \\\\\n20 \\sin 60^{\\circ}=\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}}-0 \\\\\n\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}}=10 \\sqrt{3} ; \\tan \\theta=\\frac{\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{y}}}{\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{\\mathrm{b}}\\right)_{\\mathrm{x}}}=\\frac{10 \\sqrt{3}}{40}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}\n\\end{array}\n$$"
  }
